Additional cost values require a usable lot cost.

========== API ==========

aggregate({ valuation: 'cost', withValuationValue: true, accounts: ['Assets:Fund'] })

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
commodity FUND
commodity EUR
P 2024-01-01 FUND 10 SEK
P 2024-01-01 EUR 12 SEK
2024-01-01 Opening cash
  Assets:Cash  5 SEK
  Equity:Opening
2024-01-02 Missing acquisition cost
  Assets:Fund  1 FUND
  Equity:Opening

========== ERROR ==========

Cannot value FUND at cost for Assets:Fund: a lot cost in SEK is required
